msgid "\"Allow Lifting the Network Restriction for a Thread\" was turned off, so an agent that had lifted its network restriction started again with only its own hosts. The answer it was giving was stopped; send your message again to go on."
msgstr "「允許為單一會話解除網路限制」已關閉，因此一個曾解除網路限制的代理程式已僅使用其自身主機重新啟動。它正在提供的回答已停止；請再次傳送訊息以繼續。"

msgid "\"Allow Running Outside the Sandbox\" is off in Settings > AI > Sandbox, so nothing starts outside the sandbox, and the settings that always start an agent or Claude Code outside it are ignored. To allow it, turn that setting on."
msgstr "「設定 > AI > 沙箱」中的「允許在沙箱外執行」已關閉，因此不會在沙箱外啟動任何項目，且一律在沙箱外啟動代理或 Claude Code 的設定也會被忽略。若要允許，請開啟該設定。"

